#: data/maps/VerdanturfTown_PokemonCenter_1F/scripts.inc:27
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_FaithInYourPokemon"
msgid ""
"You can't consider yourself a real\n"
"TRAINER if you don't have faith\l"
"in your POKéMON.\p"
"Only those people who can believe\n"
"in their battling POKéMON can win\l"
"through to the very end.$"
msgstr ""
"如果不相信自己的宝可梦，\n"
"就不能算是真正的训练家。\p"
"只有相信和自己一起战斗的\n"
"宝可梦的人，\l"
"才能一直赢到最后。$"

#: data/maps/VerdanturfTown_PokemonCenter_1F/scripts.inc:35
msgctxt "VerdanturfTown_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_VisitForBattleTent"
msgid ""
"The reason why anyone would visit\n"
"VERDANTURF…\p"
"It's the BATTLE TENT. It goes without\n"
"saying.\p"
"Or is there somebody here that you\n"
"came to see?$"
msgstr ""
"人们来绿荫镇的理由……\p"
"当然是对战帐篷啦。\n"
"这还用说吗？\p"
"还是说，这里有你\n"
"想见的人呢？$"
